<title>FRANCE: Credit National in line with forecasts.</title>
<headline>Credit National in line with forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The small profit of Credit National/BFCE, while down on last year partly due to a hefty 250 million franc restructuring provision, is in line with the company's three-year plan, it said.</p>
<p>The net attributable result of 98 million franc, down from 524 million, comes after a smaller 3.4 percent decrease in the net banking income to 3.939 billion francs which reflected an increase in international banking but a weakness in medium and long-term credit as well as capital investment, it added.</p>
<p>BFCE has a 10 percent rise in its net banking income.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
